    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereos of Leonard Wilson Keenan Estate Agents is delighted to present this much loved family home to the property market. It is a well maintained three-bedroom, one bathroom property with a large garden with endless possibilities and off street parking for two cars on a lovely driveway. It comes to market in good condition.    Upon entering the property, you have an entrance hallway off of which is the formal lounge. At the top of the hallway is the kitchen with a glass door leading out to the veranda and large garden. Next to the kitchen currently is a TV room which could also be a separate dining room. On the veranda there is a block storage unit and a passage to the driveway. This completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\n Upstairs there is two large bedrooms with good light and a box room. A family bathroom completes this floor. A large roof space with easy access to it provides additional storage space. Millbrook Drive is a mature and highly sought-after residential area, ideally positioned close to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, and excellent transport links, ensuring easy access to the city center and surrounding areas. This is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a well-maintained family home in a prime Dublin 13 location.\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
